OL,4,CGisele Pelicot 'humiliated' after nude 
OL,5,Cphotos sent to media to promote book   
OL,6,GGisele Pelicot has said she has been   
OL,7,G"once again humiliated" after nude     
OL,8,Gimages of her were sent to the media   
OL,9,Gto promote a book about coercive       
OL,10,Gcontrol.                               
OL,12,FThe 73-year-old told French            
OL,13,Fbroadcaster BFM TV she would take      
OL,14,Flegal action against the publisher and 
OL,15,Fauthor of the essay.                   
